        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"cc5ec714-6927-405c-b29c-0dc70901a030\",\"review_text\":\"Can't even log in GG\"},{\"review_id\":\"de004ea0-b2fd-459b-9330-b50df88e0ddd\",\"review_text\":\"Better for All Version type use.\"},{\"review_id\":\"b291072a-a6cd-4198-99ea-87bff0469f44\",\"review_text\":\"Wow . 👌\"},{\"review_id\":\"5b55846e-2f70-49c4-9d96-6188e977aac3\",\"review_text\":\"Works for a little while, then stops. Says no internet connection out of nowhere, even though there is internet. Happens every time I use the app for about an hour then stops. Fix this, it's been happening for so long!\"},{\"review_id\":\"4b8d7410-f723-4830-afd1-61f1102cd1f1\",\"review_text\":\"Realy good\"},{\"review_id\":\"8bc896a5-d38e-418a-b895-b7fc293bded9\",\"review_text\":\"Always pressing to buy premium .loads of ads\"},{\"review_id\":\"6cf35ef1-96f5-4508-9972-0f022a5398a1\",\"review_text\":\"So many ads\"},{\"review_id\":\"7827ea57-8a5c-4ce6-b98b-621be2db339d\",\"review_text\":\"Remove this app from the world\"},{\"review_id\":\"03b87353-2f44-4aa7-8a49-522013934c8c\",\"review_text\":\"Fantastic . For me, everything I wanted.\"},{\"review_id\":\"73724807-3061-4a00-86fe-64065dbd8d74\",\"review_text\":\"Not happy 😒, Spotify keeps crashing on my android, I'll open it and it will be a black screen, I delete and install it again and it works, I've had to do this 3 times already!\"}]}"
